# DATE FACTORY

## Git
Only `main`. Archive branches `legacy-v1` and `legacy-v2` may stay. Do not create other branches.

## Donor / archives
`донор` / `legacy` / «взять из донора»:
- Legacy V1: read-only `../date_factory_legacy` (`legacy-v1`)
- Legacy V2: read-only `../date_factory_legacy_v2` (`legacy-v2`)

Never edit archives. Don't ask which donor. Copy files + dependency closure into this repo; retarget `res://`. No links, submodules, or runtime paths to archives — the game must run if they are gone. Do not import old domain architecture unless asked.

## Current product
`main` is Date System Lab: 2D text dating core + developer room. Canon: `docs/MASTER_GDD.md` and `docs/DATE_SYSTEM_LAB.md`.

## How to implement
Do not only execute the literal ask. Analyze why it is needed, pick the best existing practice, and apply a mechanic already in the project. Assemble from ready systems; do not invent a parallel solution.

## Docs vs code
Documentation and code must match. Before implementing:
- Task is not in the docs → add it, then implement.
- Task is in the docs and matches the request → implement by the docs.
- Docs and request/code disagree → stop and tell the user; do not silently pick a side.

## User verifies
The user always checks the result. Agents do not play, screenshot, explore, `verify_project_runs`, or prove READY. Do not invoke `df-qa-worker` unless the user explicitly asks for QA.

## Playable, not compiled
Done = normal player route (enter, use, exit, save/load). Debug-only scenes and placeholders are not a result. Broken loop → `NOT READY`.

## Scenes / look
Godot 4.7.1, Forward Plus. Date System Lab is 2D Control UI: containers, anchors, readable at 1280×720 and 1920×1080. Don't mass-reorder `.tscn`. After generating a scene, reopen it in Godot.

## Scope
No drive-by architecture, parallel frameworks, or content scale-up before a working POC. World/economy/story/3D venues come later around the dating core.

## Subagents
If a subagent is Cursor Grok, use the latest Cursor Grok version available. Do not pin an older Grok.

## GodotIQ
Do not keep CORE in `AGENTS.md`, `.cursorrules`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.windsurfrules`, or copilot-instructions — MCP `serverUseInstructions` is enough. After `install-addon`, delete those injections. Keep `GODOTIQ_RULES.md` as on-demand full ref. Skip its play/screenshot/explore verification loops unless the user asks.
